"text": "This is a sophisticated two-piece set in a soft taupe shade. The sleeveless vest features a V-neckline and buttons down the front, sitting on high-waisted, wide-leg palazzo trousers with a smooth, matte finish."
},
{
"n": "#99·11",
"text": "These are loafers crafted from brown suede with a distinct black rubber sole. They feature a classic penny-loafer strap across the vamp."
},
{
"n": "#384·19",
"text": "This is a taupe belt made of satin, featuring a unique design where the top edge is lined with soft, feathery strands. It has long, smooth ribbons at the back that tie into a bow."
},
{
"n": "#550·22",
"text": "A spacious tote bag made from light brown suede. It features a relaxed drawstring closure with silver-toned metal beads and includes a matching small pouch attached by a string."
}
